 "article": {
  "title": "Small Orders, a Big World: How Cross-border E-commerce Connects Us",
  "topic": "经济（跨境电商·数字贸易）",
  "level": "CET-4",
  "words": 300,
  "paras": [
   "When Li Na, a small shop owner in Yiwu, China, receives an order from a customer in Brazil, she does not feel surprised anymore. Thanks to cross-border e-commerce, a product made in a Chinese town can reach a foreign doorstep in days. What was once a dream for small businesses has become an everyday reality.",
   "The rise of cross-border e-commerce rests on several pillars. First, online platforms connect sellers and buyers across borders, cutting out many middlemen. Second, faster logistics networks, including international express services and overseas warehouses, shorten delivery time greatly. Third, safer online payment systems make international transactions smoother and build trust between strangers.",
   "This new trade model brings real benefits. Small businesses can now sell to the world without opening a store abroad, while consumers enjoy more choices at lower prices. In Yiwu, for example, cross-border e-commerce import orders have broken new records this year, showing how digital trade is reshaping the global marketplace.",
   "Yet challenges remain. Different countries have different rules on taxes and product safety, and language and cultural gaps can lead to misunderstandings. Governments and platforms are working together to make rules clearer and services better. In the age of digital trade, every small order can open a big world."
  ],
  "zh": "跨境电商让中国小商户的货物几天内就能送到外国顾客手中。它依靠三大支柱：平台连接买卖双方、物流网络缩短配送时间、在线支付保障交易安全。小企业无需出国开店就能面向全球销售，消费者也能享受更多选择和更低价格。当然，各国税制、产品标准差异以及语言文化隔阂仍是挑战，政府与平台正在携手完善规则。",
  "hard": [
   {
    "en": "What was once a dream for small businesses has become an everyday reality.",
    "cn": "曾经是小企业梦想的事情，如今已成为日常现实。",
    "why": "主语从句 What was once a dream for small businesses 作整句主语，谓语是 has become；写作时可用 this 类句式引出对比。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Governments and platforms are working together to make rules clearer and services better.",
    "cn": "政府和平台正在携手让规则更清晰、服务更完善。",
    "why": "make + 宾语 + 形容词补语 结构；表目的用 to do，适合表达治理对策。"
   }
  ],
